Wow. Okay. May we see it?

104
00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.240
How did it come out?

105
00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.540
Teach us.

106
00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:11.850
So I truly believe that

107
00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.500
