138
00:05:22.206 --> 00:05:23.650
their fear mode of,

139
00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.580
Oh, I could never do that.

140
00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:27.610
I cannot thank you enough.

141
00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.280
That was mind blowing.

142
00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:33.210
